g** for answers but find only confusion, leaving everyone sticking out their **tongue** in disbelief at the complexity. The situation remains fluid and difficult to predict.\n\nP.P.S This summary reflects the transition from decriminalization back to a penalty-based system in Oregon.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Oregon", "logprob": -2.384186e-07}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.00055298593}, {"token": " pioneering", "logprob": -0.00329889}, {"token": " trial", "logprob": -1.4833412}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.03356775}, {"token": " drug", "logprob": -0.00018938188}, {"token": " dec", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "riminal", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "ization", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " ends", "logprob": -0.5304364}, {"token": " this", "logprob": -8.702316e-06}, {"token": " Sunday", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.033243205}, {"token": " replaced", "logprob": -1.1920936e-06}, {"token": " by", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " legislation", "logprob": -0.0010162389}, {"token": " that", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " reinst", "logprob": -0.020354083}, {"token": "ates", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " criminal", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " penalties", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " for", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " possessing", "logprob": -0.0011938781}, {"token": " small", "logprob": -6.4851956e-05}, {"token": " quantities", "logprob": -4.768373e-07}, {"token": " of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " hard", "logprob": -0.002639735}, {"token": " substances", "logprob": -4.768373e-07}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.0009446432}, {"token": " Under", "logprob": -0.001129132}, {"token": " the", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " new", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " statute", "logprob": -0.00022908689}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.004080683}, {"token": " individuals", "logprob": -0.53045726}, {"token": " found", "logprob": -0.15501687}, {"token": " with", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " illegal", "logprob": -4.705687}, {"token": " drugs", "logprob": -0.2611672}, {"token": " like", "lo